WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.039 line:78%
Welcome back, Architect. Chapter One invited you to awaken.

00:00:05.089 --> 00:00:11.732 line:78%
Chapter Two invites you to look honestly at your life. That can be uncomfortable.

00:00:11.782 --> 00:00:16.866 line:78%
Because the truth doesn't always tell us what we want to hear.

00:00:16.916 --> 00:00:19.623 line:78%
It tells us what we need to hear.

00:00:19.673 --> 00:00:27.054 line:78%
The purpose of this chapter isn't to judge where you are. It's to help you clearly
see it.

00:00:27.104 --> 00:00:36.289 line:78%
Only when we have the courage to see our lives honestly can we begin intentionally
creating something different.

00:00:36.339 --> 00:00:43.556 line:78%
As you move through this chapter, resist the temptation to explain, defend, or
minimize.

00:00:43.606 --> 00:00:48.609 line:78%
Simply observe. With honesty. With compassion. And with hope.

00:00:48.659 --> 00:00:55.219 line:78%
Because clarity is never the destination. It is the beginning of transformation.

00:00:55.269 --> 00:00:58.510 line:78%
When you're ready... Let's begin Chapter Two.
